{"id":"f4fc856eb9fe0887","group":"58","path":"58/batch19/58-thm-pfa.md","title":"Proper Forcing Axiom","display":"thm-pfa — Proper Forcing Axiom","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-thm-pfa","aliases":["58-thm-pfa","Proper Forcing Axiom","PFA"],"display":"thm-pfa — Proper Forcing Axiom","depends_on":["[[58-df-proper]]","[[58-df-zfc-forcing2-forcing-poset]]","[[58-df-zfc-forcing8-forcing-axiom]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-thm-pfa"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-thm-pfa</span><span>Proper Forcing Axiom</span><span>PFA</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-pfa — Proper Forcing Axiom"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"8935dcac821c0104\" href=\"?note=8935dcac821c0104\" title=\"58-df-proper\">58-df-proper</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"b5833df5ef175153\" href=\"?note=b5833df5ef175153\" title=\"58-df-zfc-forcing2-forcing-poset\">58-df-zfc-forcing2-forcing-poset</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"287ea7fe632b00c1\" href=\"?note=287ea7fe632b00c1\" title=\"58-df-zfc-forcing8-forcing-axiom\">58-df-zfc-forcing8-forcing-axiom</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p>Explicit relation signatures used below: <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ProperForcingCode}_S\\subseteq V^{1}\">\\(\\mathrm{ProperForcingCode}_S\\subseteq V^{1}\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ProperForcing}_S\\subseteq V^{3}\">\\(\\mathrm{ProperForcing}_S\\subseteq V^{3}\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcForcing2ForcingPoset}_S\\subseteq V^{3}\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcForcing2ForcingPoset}_S\\subseteq V^{3}\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcForcing8ForcingAxiom}_S\\subseteq V^{2}\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcForcing8ForcingAxiom}_S\\subseteq V^{2}\\)</span>.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb P,P,\\leq_P,1_P,\\mathcal L,\\Gamma\\in V\">\\(\\mathbb P,P,\\leq_P,1_P,\\mathcal L,\\Gamma\\in V\\)</span></p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ProperForcing}_S(P,\\leq_P,\\mathcal L)\">\\(\\mathrm{ProperForcing}_S(P,\\leq_P,\\mathcal L)\\)</span> is the order-explicit predicate from <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"8935dcac821c0104\" href=\"?note=8935dcac821c0104\" title=\"58-df-proper\">58-df-proper</a></p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcForcing2ForcingPoset}_S(P,\\leq_P,1_P)\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcForcing2ForcingPoset}_S(P,\\leq_P,1_P)\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcForcing8ForcingAxiom}_S(\\Gamma,\\omega_1)\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcForcing8ForcingAxiom}_S(\\Gamma,\\omega_1)\\)</span> are the imported forcing predicates</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ProperForcingCode}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ProperForcingCode}_S\\)</span> is the unary code predicate defined here</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PFA}\">\\(\\mathrm{PFA}\\)</span> is the displayed first-order sentence abbreviation, not a set coding the proper-forcing class</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}proper\\text{-}forcing\\text{-}code}\\vdash{}\n\\mathrm{ProperForcingCode}_S(\\mathbb P)\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists P,\\leq_P,1_P,\\mathcal L\\in V\\;\\Bigl(&amp;\n\\mathbb P=\\langle P,\\leq_P,1_P\\rangle\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\mathrm{ZfcForcing2ForcingPoset}_S(P,\\leq_P,1_P)\n\\land\\mathrm{ProperForcing}_S(P,\\leq_P,\\mathcal L)\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}proper\\text{-}forcing\\text{-}code}\\vdash{}\n\\mathrm{ProperForcingCode}_S(\\mathbb P)\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists P,\\leq_P,1_P,\\mathcal L\\in V\\;\\Bigl(&amp;\n\\mathbb P=\\langle P,\\leq_P,1_P\\rangle\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\mathrm{ZfcForcing2ForcingPoset}_S(P,\\leq_P,1_P)\n\\land\\mathrm{ProperForcing}_S(P,\\leq_P,\\mathcal L)\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}pfa}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{PFA}\\leftrightarrow\n\\forall\\Gamma\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\n\\bigl(\\forall\\mathbb P\\in\\Gamma\\;\\mathrm{ProperForcingCode}_S(\\mathbb P)\\bigr)\n\\to\\mathrm{ZfcForcing8ForcingAxiom}_S(\\Gamma,\\omega_1)\n\\Bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}pfa}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{PFA}\\leftrightarrow\n\\forall\\Gamma\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\n\\bigl(\\forall\\mathbb P\\in\\Gamma\\;\\mathrm{ProperForcingCode}_S(\\mathbb P)\\bigr)\n\\to\\mathrm{ZfcForcing8ForcingAxiom}_S(\\Gamma,\\omega_1)\n\\Bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The class of all proper forcing notions is generally a proper class and therefore cannot be passed as the set parameter <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\">\\(\\Gamma\\)</span> of the imported forcing-axiom predicate.  Quantifying over every set of proper forcing codes is equivalent (singletons already test each code) and remains inside first-order ZFC.</li>\n<li>The carrier, order, and greatest condition in a code are shared by properness and the forcing-axiom predicate.  PFA is an additional axiom, not a theorem of ZFC.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-df-proper","status":"resolved","id":"8935dcac821c0104","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-proper]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-zfc-forcing2-forcing-poset","status":"resolved","id":"b5833df5ef175153","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-zfc-forcing2-forcing-poset]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-zfc-forcing8-forcing-axiom","status":"resolved","id":"287ea7fe632b00c1","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-zfc-forcing8-forcing-axiom]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-proper","status":"resolved","id":"8935dcac821c0104","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{ProperForcing}_S(P,\\leq_P,\\mathcal L)$ is the order-explicit predicate from [[58-df-proper]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathrm{ProperForcingCode}_S\\subseteq V^{1}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ProperForcing}_S\\subseteq V^{3}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcForcing2ForcingPoset}_S\\subseteq V^{3}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcForcing8ForcingAxiom}_S\\subseteq V^{2}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbb P,P,\\leq_P,1_P,\\mathcal L,\\Gamma\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ProperForcing}_S(P,\\leq_P,\\mathcal L)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcForcing2ForcingPoset}_S(P,\\leq_P,1_P)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcForcing8ForcingAxiom}_S(\\Gamma,\\omega_1)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ProperForcingCode}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{PFA}","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}proper\\text{-}forcing\\text{-}code}\\vdash{}\n\\mathrm{ProperForcingCode}_S(\\mathbb P)\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists P,\\leq_P,1_P,\\mathcal L\\in V\\;\\Bigl(&\n\\mathbb P=\\langle P,\\leq_P,1_P\\rangle\\\\\n&\\land\\mathrm{ZfcForcing2ForcingPoset}_S(P,\\leq_P,1_P)\n\\land\\mathrm{ProperForcing}_S(P,\\leq_P,\\mathcal L)\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}pfa}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{PFA}\\leftrightarrow\n\\forall\\Gamma\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\n\\bigl(\\forall\\mathbb P\\in\\Gamma\\;\\mathrm{ProperForcingCode}_S(\\mathbb P)\\bigr)\n\\to\\mathrm{ZfcForcing8ForcingAxiom}_S(\\Gamma,\\omega_1)\n\\Bigr).","display":true},{"tex":"\\Gamma","display":false}],"bytes":2177,"backlinks":[{"id":"e46a12700e8a8a48","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{PFA}$ 是 [[../batch19/58-thm-pfa.md]] 中定义的一阶句子缩写"},{"id":"8f12f393ab28c4e4","anchor":"ref-11","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{PFA}$ 与 $\\mathrm{MM}$ 分别使用 [[../batch19/58-thm-pfa.md]] 和 [[../batch19/58-thm-MM.md]] 的闭句；在理论加法实参中同样使用其展开后的公式码。"},{"id":"eb66acfb892e62da","anchor":"ref-7","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{PFA}$ (Proper Forcing Axiom sentence, see [[../batch19/58-thm-pfa.md]])"},{"id":"e0902736e45e6217","anchor":"ref-7","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{PFA}$（proper forcing axiom，见 [[../batch19/58-thm-pfa.md]]）"},{"id":"4352151ad508938d","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{ProperForcingCode}_S$ and $\\mathrm{PFA}$ are imported from [[58-thm-pfa]]"},{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-4357","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch19/58-thm-pfa.md|58-thm-pfa]]（batch19）"},{"id":"7334957c6d59eacc","anchor":"ref-233","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[58-thm-0-sharp.md]]\n[[58-thm-L-condensation.md]]\n[[58-thm-L-definability.md]]\n[[58-thm-L-generic-extension.md]]\n[[58-thm-L-is-transitive.md]]\n[[58-thm-L-satisfies-GCH.md]]\n[[58-thm-L-satisfies-ZFC.md]]\n[[58-thm-MM.md]]\n[[58-thm-V-equal-L.md]]\n[[58-thm-V-equals-L.md]]\n[[58-thm-absoluteness-calculation.md]]\n[[58-thm-ac-wellorder-equivalent.md]]\n[[58-thm-aleph-properties.md]]\n[[58-thm-analytic-completeness.md]]\n[[58-thm-analyti